                    DIGITAL EQUIPMENT CORPORATION

                             FACT SHEET


PRODUCT NAME:  ATMworks 350 ATM Adapter


OVERVIEW:

The ATMworks 350 is an ATM network interface adapter that provides 
high performance PCI-to-ATM connectivity for PCI-based 
AlphaStations, AlphaServers and Intel-based platforms for client/
server network computing.  It is supported by Digital UNIX, Windows 
NT and Novell NetWare, and is tied with the ATMworks 750 as the 
industry-leader in performance with greater than 130 Mb/s actual 
throughput, while offering simultaneous support for 2,048 virtual 
circuits.

The ATMworks 350 is a single-slot, full sized PCI option card, 
compliant with PCI V2.0, that uses 62.5/125 multimode fiber optic 
cables and runs at 155 Mb/s with SONET/SDH framing.  It supports ATM 
Adaptation Layer 5 (AAL5), designed for class C connection-oriented 
traffic.

Multiple adapters in a system and multiprocessor system 
configurations are supported with Windows NT and planned for Digital 
UNIX 4.0.  


